hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1006","Bundar and Bishr bin Adam told us, they said: Abu Ahmad Al-Zubayri told us, Yunus bin Al-Harith told us, on the authority of Abu Awn, on the authority of his father, On the authority of Al-Mughirah bin Shu’bah, that the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to “pray on mats and tanned scalps.” Abu Bakr said: Abu This Aoun is Muhammad bin Ubaid Allah Al-Thaqafi."
